ulator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. In 2025 the middle had January to February at 43% of normal and October to November at 59%. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 55% of normal on the middle. Grid 28359 had its driest year in 1958 at 52%.</p>"}
